          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="How much does it cost?" data-es="¿Cuánto cuesta?">How much does it cost?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Every job is quoted based on the size you need and the type of material. Your quote includes delivery, pickup, a 14-day rental, and a set weight allowance — with no hidden fuel or environmental fees. Call or request a free quote and we'll give you a firm price." data-es="Cada trabajo se cotiza según el tamaño que necesitas y el tipo de material. Tu cotización incluye entrega, recogida, 14 días de renta y un límite de peso — sin cargos ocultos de combustible o ambientales. Llama o solicita una cotización gratis y te damos un precio firme.">Every job is quoted based on the size you need and the type of material. Your quote includes delivery, pickup, a 14-day rental, and a set weight allowance — with no hidden fuel or environmental fees. Call or request a free quote and we'll give you a firm price.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="What can I put in the dumpster?" data-es="¿Qué puedo poner en el contenedor?">What can I put in the dumpster?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Most construction, demo, household, and yard debris. We can't take: hazardous waste (paints, solvents, oils), tires, batteries, refrigerators with refrigerant, propane tanks, or asbestos. Ask if you're unsure — we'll point you to the right disposal." data-es="La mayoría de escombros de construcción, demolición, hogar y jardín. No aceptamos: desechos peligrosos (pinturas, solventes, aceites), llantas, baterías, refrigeradores con refrigerante, tanques de propano, o asbesto. Si no estás seguro, pregúntanos.">Most construction, demo, household, and yard debris. We can't take: hazardous waste (paints, solvents, oils), tires, batteries, refrigerators with refrigerant, propane tanks, or asbestos. Ask if you're unsure — we'll point you to the right disposal.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="Do I need a permit?" data-es="¿Necesito un permiso?">Do I need a permit?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Permits are only needed if the dumpster sits in the street or public right-of-way. Most driveways and private lots are permit-free. Each city handles it differently — we'll help you figure it out for your address." data-es="Solo se necesita permiso si el contenedor va en la calle o derecho de vía pública. Casi todas las entradas privadas no requieren permiso. Cada ciudad es distinta — te ayudamos a verificar para tu dirección.">Permits are only needed if the dumpster sits in the street or public right-of-way. Most driveways and private lots are permit-free. Each city handles it differently — we'll help you figure it out for your address.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="How long can I keep the dumpster?" data-es="¿Cuánto tiempo lo puedo tener?">How long can I keep the dumpster?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Standard rental is 14 days. Need more? Additional days are $5 each. Pickup is on request — just call when you're ready and we'll schedule it (dumpsters aren't picked up automatically)." data-es="La renta estándar es de 14 días. ¿Necesitas más? Los días adicionales cuestan $5 cada uno. La recogida es a solicitud — solo llama cuando estés listo y la agendamos (los contenedores no se recogen automáticamente).">Standard rental is 14 days. Need more? Additional days are $5 each. Pickup is on request — just call when you're ready and we'll schedule it (dumpsters aren't picked up automatically).</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <a href="/faq" class="btn btn-secondary" data-en="See all FAQs" data-es="Ver todas las preguntas">See all FAQs →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

